Comment: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.65,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,My heart throbs at the thought of youComment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.15,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Limitless power surgesComment: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:12.36,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As long as you wish,Comment: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.93,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll brandish our unchanging bondComment: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:29.24,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,decided long ago in the pastComment: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.31,Nami,,0,0,0,Code once,mau = Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Nami,,0,0,0,Code once,smoke = Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Nami,,0,0,0,code once,lightning = Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Nami,,0,0,0,template noblank,!retime("start2syl",-300+($si-1)*50,0)!Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Nami,,0,0,0,template notext noblank loop 5,!retime("presyl",0+(j-1)*100,300)!!lightning[math.random(10)]!Comment: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.31,Nami,,0,0,0,Template char noblank loop 20,!retime("syl",0,700+($si-1)*20)!!smoke[math.random(3)]!Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Nami,,0,0,0,template noblank,!retime("syl",0,600)!Comment: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.42,Nami,,0,0,0,karaoke,Thundercloud Rod!Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:41.60,Title,,0,0,0,,Not HereDialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:45.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,Treasure RepositoryDialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:47.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What a cute creature you are!Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a skeleton from tip to toe, and yet somehow you're still alive.Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You put up a pretty good fight, Soul King.Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:02:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The Chess Peacekeepers are totally afraid of you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.61,0:02:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a reason that you're called "Soul King". You're basically their nemesis.Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,Bicorne Hat NapoleonDialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,... you were unable to defeat these guys.Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:14.82,Captions,,0,0,0,,Storm Cloud ZeusDialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sun PrometheusDialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I gave them my soul, so they're a part of me.Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:25.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That means their souls are in a different class.Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:35.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We finished our inspection, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:39.90,Main,,0,0,0,,He isn't hiding anything in his clothes!Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:44.85,Main,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't have anything in this tube!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:48.19,Main,,0,0,0,,– Nor in his cane sword... – And not within his cloak.Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,He has nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:54.32,Main,,0,0,0,,He didn't steal anything!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:00.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That's good to hear, Soul King.Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:04.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I suspected you. Pet, pet.Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:08.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How frustrating. This is so humiliating.Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tamate Box is one thing,Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't be able to let you get away with stealing my Poneglyphs, either.Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Nor any of the other belongings I have.Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be foolish if I allowed another person to take them and reach Raftel again.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't make the same mistake that I did with Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.73,0:03:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,He used that strange ability to hear the Voice of All Things and read the stone.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:46.99,Main,,0,0,0,,But now I've got someone capable of using a similar ability.Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The next to reach Raftel... will be us!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:58.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:05.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear Pudding! I was just talking about you.Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What's up? Has your third eye finally revealed its power?Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:14.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mama! You ask me that every time you see me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:16.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a half-blood, remember?Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:20.48,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee that I'll ever be able to use that ability.Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:25.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:31.10,Main,,0,0,0,,But you do have the blood of the Three-Eye Tribe in your veins.Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't awaken your latent ability as a member of the Three-Eye Tribe,Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,you'll be nothing but a creepy girl.Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:45.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,P-Pudding-san...Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:46.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,... has three eyes?Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:50.81,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:53.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The fact that we know each other...Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.69,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,... must be kept secret!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:58.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's that skeleton man.Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:03.71,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see him here. Well, at least they caught him.Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, Mama? I don't feel comfortable talking to you in here. Can we go to your room?Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:12.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, of course! Anything for you.Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:48.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Cock-a-doodle-doo!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That call is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He's about to evolve into his third form!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,He's turning into Count Niwatori!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This is stupid.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll finish him off now.Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago to Viscount Hiyoko and now, to Count Niwatori!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:11.50,Note,,0,0,0,,The Tamago (egg) hatches into a Hiyoko (chick), and evolves into a Niwatori (chicken).Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The more he transforms, the more powerful he gets!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,He ate the Egg-Egg Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:20.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Count Niwatori is a true knight! You should be terrified!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Once he transforms fully, he'll have power that you'll be no match for!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:27.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop him from disrupting the transformation!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:28.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to just sit around and watch.Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll stop.Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:47.01,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is it.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:02.05,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nice to have so many soldiers around.Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! What are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:09.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Pull back!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Run away!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:19.48,Main,,0,0,0,,A decoy couldn't ask for more.Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Cock-a-doodle-doo!Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:08:00.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-WorldDialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:09.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was close! You've could've been killed, Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.59,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro, you really startled me there.Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:18.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You startled me more.Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:22.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Imagine if you were in my position, and a mirror spoke to you.Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:30.20,Main,,0,0,0,,But you managed to come up with a plan without any second thought!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just what I expected from you, Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, we're inside of the mirrors?Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This is pretty outlandish.Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,No one can come in or get out of here without Brûlée. We'll be safe here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:46.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If we find Sanji, we can escape through here with him!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:49.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you've learned!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy and Nami got caught?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I heard.Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Brook, too.Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he managed to get a copy of that Poneglyph.Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,They're all in danger! Let's hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot! Did you finish drawing everyone's portrait?Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:12.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes I did, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You did?! Good job!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, let's show the portraits to the mirrors in order to get their locations.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:20.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:26.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror! Tell us where these people are!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,They look nothing like them!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:32.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That girl with the long hair just ran past me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The mirror talked!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What? So, did Nami break out?  Is she with Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.72,Main,,0,0,0,,She was with Boss Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:44.77,Main,,0,0,0,,J... Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:51.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,Baum Cake, Third FloorDialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:54.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me if you're here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:56.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:09:59.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.82,0:10:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got something to tell you! Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:07.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta hear me out!Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did Straw Hat go?Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:23.09,Main,,0,0,0,,He's too fast! Which way did he go?Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Did he go in here?Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The door won't open!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,– Let's go that way! – Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:43.37,Main,,0,0,0,,You're... Sanji's sister!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That's correct.Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:47.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you want? I'm in a hurry here!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're looking for Sanji, aren't you? You just missed him.Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Really?! Where'd he go?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:59.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding lied to us!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding, who Sanji thinks he's marrying... told me that she's going to kill him!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Did you get hurt?Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:13.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for asking. I'm fine.Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, my brother already knows about Pudding.Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:20.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Has he known the whole time?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.99,Main,,0,0,0,,He just found out about her.Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I tried to convince him to escape from this island,Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:32.25,Main,,0,0,0,,but he was worried about the hostages in the East Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,... and your crew as well.Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hostages? Do you mean the people at the Baratie?Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I know them, too. If they're really in any danger, I'll go back to the East Blue and fight to protect them!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:49.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat something?Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:51.06,Main,,0,0,0,,N-No, I'll be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be here waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:05.79,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you don't come back, I'll be here...Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:08.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... starving to death!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:12.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're the cook of my ship!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:18.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I won't eat anything other than what you cook!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:29.10,Main,,0,0,0,,But... this is good.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:33.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji knows about Pudding.Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as he's not being tricked, I'm happy.Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:42.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I've done everything else I can!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:46.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you, Sanji's sister!Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Why are you going that way?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't where I promised to meet him!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:17.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We'll chop this guy's head off.Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:23.44,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You are my sacrifice, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:32.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't try to run away, everything will work out just fine, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.37,0:13:37.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,At the wedding tomorrow...Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:40.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... the entire Vinsmoke Family...Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.05,0:13:44.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... will be executed!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:53.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Get packing, you low-class pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:05.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's too late for me to turn back, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:15.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Something hit my house!Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,– My house! – What's going on? It's so late.Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:24.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that a person?Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.99,Main,,0,0,0,,We found you.Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta get there as soon as possible.Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:08.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be here waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:21.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I've gotta be waiting...Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,... at that spot!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Block off the exits!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We're about to be surrounded.Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:49.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Isn't there a way out?Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:53.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you handle the rear, Nami?Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:56.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on me! I'm getting tired of this.Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,,There they are!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:04.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are annoying!Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:31.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:34.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:39.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! We're here to save you!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:42.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! I'm so sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! There are more enemies up ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:50.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! Get in the mirror now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:56.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, ow, ow!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Prometheus?Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:17:01.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,Queen's Chamber, Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:03.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The wound I got from Soul King is deeper than I thought...Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,... and now it's starting to hurt again!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:07.75,Main,,0,0,0,,How pathetic!Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:11.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, we should give him some credit.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:16.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Because no one's ever been able to hurt you guys before.Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:22.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, are you really going to keep holding onto that skeleton?Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:27.68,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What? "That skeleton"? Pudding-san, how could you refer to me like that?Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yeah, of course! – Too close!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:34.36,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no other creature like this! It's a work of soul art!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd rather carry him around for a while instead of putting him in a book.Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:40.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:44.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job on tricking the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:49.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I never expected them to get through the Seducing Woods.Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:54.75,Main,,0,0,0,,But now they're trapped in a book in the Prison Library.Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:18:00.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I went to see them, too. It serves them right.Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:02.22,Main,,0,0,0,,"It serves them right"?Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:06.32,Main,,0,0,0,,– Are you gonna kill them? – Yeah, after the wedding ceremony.Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:10.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I sent barmaids over to Germa.Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:14.98,Main,,0,0,0,,They're probably in a drunken stupor right now, and won't be expecting anything!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:19.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Good... But Reiju was investigating me.Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:24.16,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a pretty sharp person. It's a good thing I took care of her.Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:28.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What? You didn't kill her, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:32.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mama! Don't you trust me?! I just shot her leg!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:35.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I shot her once, and then erased her memories.Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:39.09,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:47.35,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Pudding-san? Aren't you a sweet girl?Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:53.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You need to be careful. You're my precious bride.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be a major problem if she tried to get revenge.Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:19:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your concern, Mama. But...Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:04.49,Main,,0,0,0,,... thanks to her, I got to test out this gun.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:11.62,Main,,0,0,0,,With this gun, even Germa's modified bodies won't stand a chance.Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:16.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That's great, very great.Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You're such a smart girl.Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:26.18,Main,,0,0,0,,When you open fire tomorrow, that'll be the signal for our plan to begin.Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:33.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be watching when it's time for the wedding kiss.Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:39.78,Main,,0,0,0,,That dopey-faced Sanji will lift your veil and try to kiss you.Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:41.99,Main,,0,0,0,,That's when...Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:46.87,Main,,0,0,0,,... he'll see your third eye for the first time!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,In that moment, he'll see his beautiful bride's creepy face...Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,... and he'll be distracted for a moment!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:06.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That'll be your cue, okay? You'll have to finish him off with one shot.Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:10.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Aim right between his eyes! Right here.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:20.41,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Pudding-san is going to kill Sanji-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:24.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be in shock, and be unable to move.Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:29.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The people of Germa will realize they're in danger, and try to run...Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,... but it'll already be too late at that point!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:38.31,Main,,0,0,0,,As the unarmed Vinsmokes turn around to run, they'll notice a wall of guns pointing at them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:45.70,Main,,0,0,0,,They won't even have time to show fear before their blood spills.Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:48.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Gunshots will be going off like fireworks!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.51,0:20:52.93,Main,,0,0,0,,A rain of bullets will continue to pierce their bodies, even long after they die!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.93,0:20:55.94,Main,,0,0,0,,There'll be a giant pool of blood spreading on the ground!Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:21:00.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The six Vinsmokes will be nothing but mutiliated corpses!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.11,0:21:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,The gunshots will be shots of joy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:06.66,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's when the real party begins!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:11.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll celebrate with the cake. We'll toast with tea!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Once they lose their useless leader...Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:22.20,Main,,0,0,0,,... all of Germa will belong to me!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:26.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-WorldDialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Chobro?Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:33.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! We're inside the mirror?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! Why are you with these rats?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:39.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée.Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:42.36,Main,,0,0,0,,This is obviously treason.Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:49.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard you tried to leave our crew, but when faced with the roulette, you cowered in fear!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:57.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to repay Mama for protecting Fishman Island after Whitebeard's death.Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.66,0:22:01.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Since I wanted to leave, I wanted to do so honorably for her sake.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:06.76,Main,,0,0,0,,But I could only sense death and malice from that roulette.Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.34,0:22:09.14,Main,,0,0,0,,A roulette?Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:13.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You made the correct choice not to spin it, "Knight of the Sea" Jinbe.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:22.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Five years ago, my partner turned that roulette wheel, and asked Big Mom for mercy...Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,... but he lost his life instead.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.39,0:22:31.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Those that spin that thing are guaranteed to die. It was made that way.Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.05,0:22:33.20,Main,,0,0,0,,So it's rigged?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:40.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course it is, you fools! Mama would never let anyone leave alive!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether it's a minor intruder...Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:47.67,Main,,0,0,0,,... or an affiliated pirate who was once loyal!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:53.34,Main,,0,0,0,,She welcomes all who come to this land... and kills those who leave!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:54.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Mama's-Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.65,0:22:56.06,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving! We need to find Brook, Luffy, and Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not moving again! There's too many of you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:13.20,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sanji's RoomDialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:26.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. Sanji-sama, the groom, is fast asleep in his room.Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him out or let anyone in until morning. Keep a close eye on that door.Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.70,0:23:33.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I fell asleep-nasu! In Sanji-sama's bed!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.02,0:23:47.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he not back yet-nasu?Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:51.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess he won't come back any time soon-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I might as well sleep a little more-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:24:01.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Meeting RoomDialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, Pekoms was with them until they got to Chocolat Town.Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.92,0:24:03.12,Main,,0,0,0,,They're trying to get Sanji back.Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.14,0:24:06.34,Main,,0,0,0,,There were six of them when Pudding lured them to the main island.Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama has Soul King now.Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch this!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.71,0:24:17.82,Main,,0,0,0,,And Pedro was in the courtyard on the third floor when he blew himself up, right?Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.82,0:24:19.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed-cock-a-doo.Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:21.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's two taken care of.Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:26.68,Main,,0,0,0,,And of the four who entered the Seducing Woods... the rabbit and raccoon dog...Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.68,0:24:31.44,Main,,0,0,0,,... were caught by Big Sis Brûlée. She informed us of this earlier today.Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.32,0:24:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,That means we've taken care of four of the six. That leaves...Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.41,0:24:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,... the two who defeated Big Brother Cracker and escaped from the Seducing Woods.Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.98,0:24:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,They were definitely imprisoned in the underground Prison Library.Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.34,0:24:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,So why are we getting reports that they escaped?Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.75,0:25:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Only one of us was there in the Prison Library.Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.74,0:25:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened, Big Brother Opera? What's this about Jinbe showing up?Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.60,0:25:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a lie! Don't make me repeat myself-fa!Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.10,0:25:20.60,Main,,0,0,0,,In fact, where is he now?Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:25.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody has reported a thing-fa! Nobody came down to the basement!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.16,0:25:31.55,Main,,0,0,0,,As Mama ordered, I was trying to get Lola's whereabouts out of them!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,They didn't know anything, so I burned them alive!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:39.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I know I went a little overboard.Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:46.78,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't you trust your older brother, Mont d'Or?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:49.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.40,0:25:56.56,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can admit that I let them get away! Never ever!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.56,0:25:59.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Mama will take away my lifespan if she finds out-fa!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.79,0:26:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What about Sanji and the Vinsmokes?Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,They're in their rooms.Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.91,0:26:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, then everything is fine!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.59,0:26:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,All the intruders have been caught!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.52,0:26:18.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Right now, in the great kitchen, they're preparing the feast for tomorrow!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.15,0:26:24.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's make tomorrow the greatest wedding ever for our precious little sister, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.57,0:26:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.49,0:26:41.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Cover more ground and continue to patrol through the night.Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.31,0:26:42.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.41,0:26:45.83,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can't trust Opera on this one.Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:49.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,Medical Room, Third FloorDialogue: 0,0:26:52.96,0:26:57.34,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:26:57.38,0:26:59.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,Inside the ChateauDialogue: 0,0:27:01.05,0:27:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,My goodness... Did I make this for Pudding-chan?Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.58,0:27:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I made their favorite foods.Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.89,0:27:30.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Forget them! Forget them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.44,0:27:45.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I don't need to worry about Luffy and the others. They can escape on their own.Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:49.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The evil army of Vinsmokes will die, and so will I.Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.89,0:27:52.31,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It'll all go according to Big Mom's plan.Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.31,0:27:54.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is for the best.Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Our enemies will be satisfied by getting what they want.Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.97,0:28:01.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's been short, but I've had a fulfilling life.Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.16,0:28:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, food!Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:10.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you Vinsmoke Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.16,0:28:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Mont d'Or said you were sleeping in your room.Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.58,0:28:19.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If you don't come back, I'll be here...Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.18,0:28:21.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... starving to death!Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:24.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch that!Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.39,0:28:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,That meat there...Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,... doesn't belong to you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.18,0:28:45.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard a loud noise down the hall!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:53.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You son of a...Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.88,0:29:00.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.47,0:29:07.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I doing?Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.56,0:29:18.91,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Attack Effects: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 1,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.59,0:00:02.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 2,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 1,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 2,0:00:02.26,0:00:02.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 1,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 2,0:00:02.65,0:00:03.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 1,0:00:01.71,0:00:02.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 2,0:00:02.92,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 1,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.14,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 2,0:00:03.14,0:00:03.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,moDialogue: 2,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,moDialogue: 1,0:00:01.83,0:00:03.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:03.82,0:00:04.28,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:00:01.87,0:00:03.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 2,0:00:03.98,0:00:04.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.91,0:00:04.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 2,0:00:04.31,0:00:04.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 1,0:00:01.95,0:00:04.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 2,0:00:04.61,0:00:05.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.99,0:00:04.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,naDialogue: 2,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.55,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,naDialogue: 1,0:00:02.03,0:00:05.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tteDialogue: 2,0:00:05.25,0:00:05.93,Kar